<title>USA: Hughes Supply completes Dixie purchase.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply completes Dixie purchase.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said on Friday it completed its previously announced acquisition of Dixie Forming &amp; Building Specialties Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Dixie, of Raleigh, N.C., is a wholesale distributor of building materials.</p>
